                <pb facs="0479" n="363" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg363"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 422.11G93/816.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Quito</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-10-21T15:00:00-05:14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 21, 1915—3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My telegram of October 20, 5 p.m. Negotiations mentioned were solicited by
                    Ecuadorian officials within forty-eight hours after note was presented.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hartman</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
